                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A挑衅坏笑}是在等你——\n再被大风吹起来的时机！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990037_1583453629_content",
                "value": "{A挑衅坏笑}是在等你——\n再被大风吹起来的时机！",
                "duration": null,
